'''''Daucus elegans''''', Spanish: ''perejil de Monteverde'' (parsley of Monteverde),<ref>{{NCBI taxid|386067|''Cryptotaenia elegans''}}</ref> is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the genus ''[[Daucus]]''. It is endemic to the [[Canary Islands]].

